## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 22+ ([Download](https://nodejs.org/))
- npm or pnpm
- (Optional) Docker for containerized development

### Install Dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

### Development Mode

Start all services:

```bash
# Using Nx
nx run-many -t serve

# Or individually
nx serve website     # http://localhost:3001
nx serve dashboard   # http://localhost:3000
nx serve api         # http://localhost:3333
```

### Using Docker Compose

```bash
# Start all services with PostgreSQL and Redis
docker-compose up

# Build and start
docker-compose up --build

# Run in background
docker-compose up -d

# View logs
docker-compose logs -f

# Stop all services
docker-compose down
```

