## 🧪 Testing

### E2E Tests with Playwright

```bash
# Install browsers
cd e2e && npm run install:browsers

# Run tests (requires all apps running)
cd e2e && npm test

# Run with UI mode
cd e2e && npm run test:ui

# Run in headed mode (see browser)
cd e2e && npm run test:headed

# View test report
cd e2e && npm run report
```

### Running Tests with Nx

```bash
# Run all tests
nx run-many -t test

# Run specific app tests
nx test api
nx test dashboard

# Run E2E tests
nx test e2e
```

